  "description": "Powerful. Comfortable. Ready for Every Adventure.\n\nThe E11EVEN DEFIANT Step-Thru Fat Tire Electric Bike is designed for riders who want more power, more comfort, and more freedom. Featuring a powerful 750W motor, long-range 48V 15Ah battery, and rugged 26\" × 4.0 fat tires, DEFIANT delivers confident performance on city roads, gravel paths, and outdoor trails.\n\nThe low-step frame design makes getting on and off easier, while the aluminum alloy frame, hydraulic disc brakes, and front suspension provide a smooth and stable riding experience.\n\nKey Features\n\n⚡ 750W Powerful Motor\nReach speeds up to 28 MPH with strong acceleration and reliable climbing power.\n\n🔋 Long-Range Battery Performance\nEquipped with a 48V 15Ah battery delivering up to 90 miles of range on a single charge.\n\n🚲 Step-Thru Comfort Design\nLow-step frame structure provides easier access and a comfortable riding position.\n\n🌄 All-Terrain Fat Tires\n26\" × 4.0 anti-puncture fat tires provide excellent stability and traction on different surfaces.\n\n🛡️ Reliable Safety System\nHydraulic disc brakes offer smooth and responsive stopping power.\n\n📦 Built for Everyday Adventures\nSupports up to 400 lbs total load and features a rear rack capacity of 100 lbs for carrying essentials.",
